WEBVTT

00:06:29.897 --> 00:06:32.197
with kindness and compassion

00:06:32.221 --> 00:06:34.208
so that they can set them free

00:06:34.232 --> 00:06:36.489
and find their way back to each other.

00:06:37.019 --> 00:06:41.545
So my friends in the bar are faced
with the question under the question,

00:06:41.569 --> 00:06:44.374
not, "How do we sustain
a strong connection?"

00:06:44.398 --> 00:06:46.885
but, "How do we find our way back to it?"

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:50.240
And, yes, there is science
to answer this question,

00:06:50.264 --> 00:06:52.475
but in 25 years as a sex educator,

00:06:52.499 --> 00:06:54.805
one thing I have learned
is sometimes, Emily,

00:06:54.829 --> 00:06:56.170
less science,

00:06:57.127 --> 00:06:58.603
more hedgehogs.

00:06:58.627 --> 00:07:00.750
So I told them about me.